To destroy such weapon, average explosives 
won't do a thing.

I think it is good to explode teleport magic 
to collapse the space.

Let's name the explosive, "Destroyed Bomb" 
as it will be disappeared without a trace.

In order to make the explosive, strong and 
unstable energy source is absolutely necessary.
Defeat Tulla in Ice Mine (1st floor), 
and bring back his evil crystal.